===Etymology===
1651, {{etyl|LL.|en}} ''rescission,'' {{term|rescissio|lang=la}},<ref>{{R:Merriam Webster Online}}</ref> from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|rescindo|rescindō|I cut back|lang=la}}, from {{term|re-||back|lang=la}} + {{term|scindo|scindō|I cut|lang=la}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An act of [[removing]], taking away, or [[taking]] [[back]].
# {{context|legal|lang=en}} The undoing of a [[contract]]; [[repeal]].

